<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Foster's says year EBIT to be higher.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Foster's says year EBIT to be higher.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foster's Brewing Group Ltd said on Monday it expected earnings before interest and tax (EBIT) to be higher in the year to June 30 compared with a year earlier.</p>
<p>However, Foster's said interest costs and the re-emergence of tax liability on Australian income would have an impact on the overall earnings for the 1996/97 year.</p>
</text>
